# Owner half of the imported-functor -constants pair
# (tests/test_constants.py::test_constants_rhs_can_construct_an_imported_functor).
#
# Declares a DATA functor and nothing else: post-P3-2 (THE FLIP, R6) the name
# binds its interned spelling here, so an importer gets a str, not a class --
# which is exactly the shape a -constants RHS in the importer has to cope
# with.
-module(const_functor_owner, [Wrap(SUB), Pair(LEFT, RIGHT)])
